# OpenCode's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-opencode-setting-cookie = 您的 opencode.ai 会话。登录 https://opencode.ai/auth，打开开发者工具 > Application > Cookies > https://opencode.ai，复制 auth 和 __Host-console_session Cookie（仅其中一个也可）。以 "auth=value; __Host-console_session=value" 的形式粘贴。
usage-opencode-setting-workspace-id = 可选。要读取的工作区，可填写 wrk_... ID 或其控制台的 https://opencode.ai/workspace/... URL。默认为账号的第一个工作区。

## The report: a subscription workspace's windows, or a pay-as-you-go
## workspace's Zen balance and monthly spend. Zen is OpenCode's name for
## its model gateway.

usage-opencode-zen-balance = Zen 余额
usage-opencode-monthly-limit-left = 每月限额剩余
# The plan line of a workspace without a subscription.
usage-opencode-pay-as-you-go = 按量付费
usage-opencode-this-month = 本月
usage-opencode-spent = 已花费
